<title>UK: BG DISCOVERS GAS OFFSHORE TRINIDAD.</title>
<headline>BG DISCOVERS GAS OFFSHORE TRINIDAD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British gas transport and production company BG Plc on Tuesday said it found gas off Trinidad's north coast.</p>
<p>BG discovered the gas as it drilled the Hibiscus-2a and Hibiscus-3 wells on behalf of co-venturers Agip SpA from Italy and Deminex from Germany.</p>
<p>Tests conducted on the Hibiscus-3 well confirmed excellent reservoir productivity, BG said.</p>
<p>The discovery extends the proven Hibiscus gas field by more than 15 kilometres into the BG/Agip/Deminex licensed acreage, the UK company added.</p>
<p>-- Hans de Jongh, London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
